    "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nOn CUDA, GDN prefill reads q/k/v/z/b/a as strided views of the input projection (`qwen3_5_gdn_prefill_projection_views`). ROCm still copies them into contiguous buffers with `fused_qkvzba_split_reshape_cat_contiguous_kernel.`(conv1d, chunked GDN, gated norm) already take strided inputs, so on ROCm the copy is pure overhead.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- `Qwen3_5GatedDeltaNet.forward`: enable `use_strided_prefill_z` on HIP as well as CUDA (`_is_cuda` -> `_is_cuda or _is_hip`).\r\n- Affected: prefill (extend without speculative decoding) in the GDN linear-attention layers, for models whose v/k head ratio takes the fused-unpack branch.\r\n- It applies to models whose head ratio takes the fused-unpack branch. Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (ratio 3) reaches that branch once #44302 is merged.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nGSM8K, full 1319 questions, 5-shot, real MTP acceptance. MI355X, TP1, `SGLANG_USE_AITER=1`.\r\n\r\n| Model | before | after |\r\n|---|---:|---:|\r\n| Qwen3.8-Flash-Next MXFP4 (on top of #44302) | 97.73% | 97.73% |\r\n\r\nQwen3.5-397B-A17B MXFP4 (ratio 4), TP1, cookbook MI355X env, `few_shot_gsm8k` with 400 questions: 92.0% before, 94.8% after.\r\n\r\n`test_gdn_prefill_layout.py` and `test_gdn_fused_split_head_ratios.py` pass on MI355X with and without `SGLANG_USE_AITER`. The exception is the compact conv block-table subtests, which cover a CUDA-only feature and fail on HIP with or without this change.\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests\r\n\r\nQwen3.8-Flash-Next MXFP4 on top of #44302, MI355X TP1, MTP 3/1/4, random dataset ISL 32768 / OSL 4096, concurrency 16, 48 prompts, 2 runs per arm.\r\n\r\n| | before | after | Δ |\r\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| Mean TTFT (ms) | 8662 | 8440 | **-2.6%** |\r\n| Output throughput (tok/s) | 964.4 | 972.0 | +0.8% |\r\n| Mean TPOT (ms) | 14.48 | 14.40 | -0.6% |\r\n\r\nThe gain is in prefill. All \"after\" runs beat all \"before\" runs on TTFT, in this test and in an earlier one with a different server config (TTFT -2.6% there as well).\r\n\r\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\r\n---\r\n### CI States\r\n\r\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40849438894](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40849438894)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40849438750](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40849438750)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40849438966](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40849438966)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\r\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
